# Feature Loop Run Directory
#
# This directory stores runtime state for feature loop executions.
# Each run creates a subdirectory named after the feature branch.
#
# Directory structure per run:
# runs/feature-branch-name/
# ├── progress.log              - Append-only iteration log
# ├── prd-snapshot.json         - PRD state at loop start
# ├── iteration-1-output.txt    - Full Claude output from iteration 1
# ├── iteration-2-output.txt    - Full Claude output from iteration 2
# └── ...
#
# These directories are ephemeral and can be cleaned up after loops complete.
